---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const updated = '10 November 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How WattFlow's tax calculators handle your data: the figures you enter stay in your browser. What analytics and advertising run, what cookies are used, and how to contact us."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="page prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="small muted">Last updated {updated}.</p>

      <div class="note note--info">
        <strong>The short version.</strong> The calculators run in your own browser tab. The wages, tips, overtime and
        income figures you type are not sent to us and are not stored by us.
      </div>

      <h2>What you type into a calculator</h2>
      <p>
        The calculations are done by JavaScript on your device. There is no account, no form submission and no server
        endpoint that receives your figures. Closing the tab discards them.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and records aggregate page views, referrers, country and
        basic device information. We may also use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong>, which sets cookies and receives
        page views and coarse device and country information. Neither receives the figures you enter into a calculator.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site may display advertising supplied by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies or similar
        technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can control personalised
        advertising in{' '}
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a> and opt
        out of third-party vendor cookies at{' '}
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>. You can also block
        or delete cookies in your browser; the calculators work the same without them.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to our app</h2>
      <p>
        Some pages link to our Shift Work Calendar app on Google Play. The link carries campaign tags that tell us which
        page it came from; it never carries anything you typed into a calculator.
      </p>

      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by a static hosting provider that keeps standard request logs (IP address, user agent,
        requested URL) for security and abuse prevention.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is about adult tax filing and is not directed at children.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Because the calculators collect nothing, there is generally nothing for us to access, correct or erase. If you
        believe we hold data about you, contact us and we will respond within 30 days. If you are in the EU or UK, you may
        also complain to your national data protection authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page will change too.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
